# 9. BUILD SUPERVISOR STATE MACHINE

The supervisor should wake approximately every 30–60 seconds.

It must persist its own small reconciliation metadata under:

```text
/home/ash/.local/state/empirium-autobuild/
```

It must be idempotent.

It must tolerate repeated ticks.

The algorithm is conceptually:

```text
FOREVER:

    verify Gateway health

    verify Kanban dispatcher health

    inspect active Kanban board

    inspect worker/run states

    inspect provider health

    inspect target Git state

    run/read deterministic product acceptance gate

    reclaim/recover stale execution where appropriate

    IF final product acceptance == PASS:
        run final evidence verification
        IF final evidence verification == PASS:
            mark autonomous build COMPLETE
            enter completed/idle monitoring mode
        ELSE:
            create bounded repair WorkItems for failed evidence
        CONTINUE

    parse every failed acceptance predicate

    ensure every failed predicate has actionable durable work

    IF failed predicate has no active WorkItem:
        create bounded diagnostic/implementation WorkItem

    inspect blocked cards

    classify each block:
        provider/transient
        failed implementation
        failed test
        QA rejection
        goal-turn exhaustion
        bad model/no progress
        dependency
        real human blocker

    provider/transient:
        schedule retry with bounded exponential backoff
        continue all unrelated runnable work

    repeated no-progress:
        do NOT retry the identical route indefinitely
        create/route diagnosis or use a fresh model/provider path
        retain previous Attempt history

    failed test:
        generate rework against same logical requirement

    QA rejection:
        generate rework against same logical requirement

    goal-turn exhaustion:
        preserve progress
        create a continuation/recovery Attempt or bounded follow-up card
        DO NOT interpret exhaustion as project completion

    crashed worker:
        reclaim and retry

    disappeared worker:
        reclaim and retry

    Gateway restarted:
        reconstruct from durable Kanban state

    true missing credential/irreversible approval:
        record precise HUMAN_BLOCKED state
        continue all independent work
        keep supervisor alive
        periodically re-evaluate the blocker

    if zero READY/RUNNING cards but acceptance != PASS:
        this is a CONTROL-PLANE FAILURE CONDITION
        automatically create a diagnosis/replanning card

    sleep
```

The most important invariant is:

> **ACCEPTANCE FAIL + NO ACTIVE WORK is not allowed.**

If acceptance is FAIL and the board has no actionable work, the supervisor MUST create recovery/replanning work.

